    "summary": "The user expresses extreme existential despair and nihilism stemming from a perceived failure to achieve greatness, eventually hinting at the logic of \"stopping.\" The assistant attempts to provide empathetic reframing by suggesting the user \"rewrite their own script\" rather than giving up.",
